=== REASONING ===
Error: Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'includes')
Root cause: .includes() called on undefined/null values from API responses.
All API responses are valid, but some fields may be null/undefined when
the Tesla vehicle hasn't reported certain signals yet.

Fix strategy: Add null guards to all .includes() call sites where the
receiver could be undefined/null from API data.

